        f"Nothing else is asked. Companion OS will be installed with:\n<b>{esc(region_text)}</b>\n"
        f"(wrong? press \"{esc(BTN_REGION)}\")\n\n"
        f"Sign in afterwards as  <b>companion</b>  with this one-time password:\n<tt><big><b>{esc(password)}</b></big></tt>\n"
        "(you will be asked to choose your own at first sign-in; write it down now)\n\n"
        "When the installation is finished the computer turns off: remove the USB stick, then turn it on."
    )
